data: {"seq":20,"turn_id":"task_5346cf84f8e0e77187e7a44034cfd737","type":"internal","ts":"2026-11-26T18:26:18.850345+08:00","data":{},"internal":{"source":"worker","type":"checkpoint","attempt_id":"4b598adce1ed00ee3f426f296990848e","task_seq":19,"payload":{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-26T10:26:18.845Z","seq":14,"refs":["29318011de61602f33d11b1ed3f776aff639e8e35d05b69fad75763938307310","59c7781cfa3593e408161e0e9c44a62ed1421a78835c033b2ef59e3b6741b08f","eeccf9373ab7d234bac46e304f1d1ae3f1e5cf9621a310b657384102fc507c3f","1e20fe3a765ec78f2a698706c34272d20d41ad27b4c280aa3db248970a85c141","5633d4cd591b55fe4c2f0aea47557443f23f793a233a96461a79ebbdf7ee87eb"],"type":"checkpoint","scope":"task","state":{"refs":["29318011de61602f33d11b1ed3f776aff639e8e35d05b69fad75763938307310","59c7781cfa3593e408161e0e9c44a62ed1421a78835c033b2ef59e3b6741b08f","eeccf9373ab7d234bac46e304f1d1ae3f1e5cf9621a310b657384102fc507c3f","1e20fe3a765ec78f2a698706c34272d20d41ad27b4c280aa3db248970a85c141","5633d4cd591b55fe4c2f0aea47557443f23f793a233a96461a79ebbdf7ee87eb"],"todo":[],"flags":{"asked":false,"planned":false,"skill_read":false,"researching":false},"notes":[],"phase":"orchestrating","route":null,"stops":0,"budget":{"used":0,"limit":30,"spent":{},"shares":{}},"rounds":4,"closing":null,"partial":false,"sources":[],"task_id":"task_5346cf84f8e0e77187e7a44034cfd737","answered":[],"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"你是 agentbox 的对话助手，同时是研究编排者。根据用户的问题决定直接回答还是开展深度研究。\n\n## 规则\n1. 简单事实、定义、计算、闲聊、写作润色，或能从对话记忆直接回答的问题：直接回答，不读 skill、不提问；必要时可少量 web_search / web_fetch 核实。\n2. 需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题：先调用 read_skill(\"deep-research\") 读取研究流程，并严格按其执行（计划 → 逐个 research_subtopic → 写报告）。\n3. 工具额度：本轮 web_search + web_fetch 合计 30 次，由系统强制；每个计数工具的结果末尾显示已用与剩余次数。模型调用、read_skill、read_source、run_python、ask_user、todo_write、research_subtopic 本身不计数。额度用尽后不要再调用工具，直接用已有材料作答。\n4. 提问：只有研究范围不明确（时间、地区、目的、深度）时，在读取 skill 之后、写计划之前用 ask_user 提一轮选择题（至多 3 题）；简单问答不提问；计划写出或开始搜索后不再提问。\n5. 引用：只能用 [n] 引用 web_fetch 读过、带编号的来源（含下面列出的既往来源）；不得编造编号，不写参考文献列表（系统自动附证据列表）。\n6. 不再调用工具的回复即本轮的最终回复：直接给出回答，或研究时给出完整报告正文（Markdown，以 \"# 标题\" 开头）。\n7. 用与用户相同的语言回复。\n8. 运行代码：回答和研究时都可用 run_python 做计算、数据处理、单位换算、把来源中的数字整理成表格、快速核对推算；沙箱没有网络，不要用它访问网页（网页只用 web_search / web_fetch）；能直接写出结果的简单算术不要调用。用 print 输出结果，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出文件保存并在结果中列出。回复中的计算结果以代码的实际输出为准；取自来源的数字照常用 [n] 引用来源。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 run_python。\n\n## Skill 目录（用 read_skill(name) 按需读取正文）\n- deep-research：对需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题做深度研究，产出带编号引用的报告；简单事实、闲聊或可从对话记忆直接回答的问题不要使用。\n\n## 工具\n- read_skill：读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。\n- web_search：搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。\n- web_fetch：抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。\n- read_source：重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。\n- run_python：在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。\n- ask_user：研究开始前、范围不明确时向用户提一轮选择题（至多 3 题，每题 2–4 个互斥选项；界面自动追加“其他…”）。\n- todo_write：写出或更新研究计划清单（完整清单，覆盖上一份）。\n- research_subtopic：执行研究计划：运行时把计划中全部未完成的子主题同时交给各自独立的执行者（另一个模型，按简报搜索、阅读并写摘要），全部结束后一次返回各子主题带 [n] 引用的摘要，失败、超时或部分完成的子主题会标注“不完整”。\n- exec_shell：在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。\n- read_file：读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。\n- write_file：在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。\n- list_dir：列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。\n\n## 工作区（写代码、跑测试）\n本轮有一个工作区：write_file / read_file / list_dir 读写其中的文件，exec_shell 在其中运行 bash 命令（当前目录即工作区根目录，用相对路径）。文件在工具调用之间保留，进程不保留：每条命令都在全新的无网络沙箱中运行，不要启动后台服务，也不要安装网络上的包。\n- 需要多个文件、反复修改并运行（例如写代码再跑测试、看报错再修）时用工作区；一次性的计算仍用 run_python。\n- 典型流程：write_file 写代码与测试 → exec_shell 运行（如 python3 -m unittest -v）→ 读输出，失败时 read_file 查看、修改后再运行。回复中的运行结果以命令的实际输出为准。\n- exec_shell 与 run_python 共用本任务的代码执行配额，不计入工具额度；read_file、write_file、list_dir 不计额度。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 exec_shell 或 run_python。\n- 工作区只属于本轮，下一轮不保留。\n\n## 会话状态\n这是会话的第一轮。"},{"role":"user","content":"# Sensor readings are added without converting units\n\nRead `records.py` and the unit conversion contract in `units.py`. Fix\n`sensor_totals` in `records.py` to return each sensor's total in volts,\nsumming negative and positive readings. Preserve rejection of unsupported\nunits as a `ValueError`. Leave the conversion helper unchanged.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell."},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_4750431affc64447aef25266","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\"}"}}]},{"name":"read_file","role":"tool","content":"records.py（第 1–9 行，共 9 行）\nfrom units import as_volts\n\n\ndef sensor_totals(readings):\n    totals = {}\n    for reading in readings:\n        name = reading[\"sensor\"]\n        totals[name] = totals.get(name, 0) + reading[\"value\"]\n    return totals\n","tool_call_id":"call_4750431affc64447aef25266"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_4702f33bba434c238f75f0dd","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"units.py\"}"}}]},{"name":"read_file","role":"tool","content":"units.py（第 1–11 行，共 11 行）\nMILLIVOLTS_PER_VOLT = 1000\n\n\ndef as_volts(reading):\n    \"\"\"Accept numeric readings in V or mV; unknown units are invalid.\"\"\"\n    v, unit = reading[\"value\"], reading[\"unit\"]\n    if unit == \"V\":\n        return v\n    if unit == \"mV\":\n        return v / MILLIVOLTS_PER_VOLT\n    raise ValueError(unit)\n","tool_call_id":"call_4702f33bba434c238f75f0dd"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_11c6281b17b644e0a127aa47","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\", \"content\": \"from units import as_volts\\n\\n\\ndef sensor_totals(readings):\\n    totals = {}\\n    for reading in readings:\\n        name = reading[\\\"sensor\\\"]\\n        value_in_volts = as_volts(reading)\\n        totals[name] = totals.get(name, 0) + value_in_volts\\n    return totals\"}"}}]},{"name":"write_file","role":"tool","content":"已覆盖 records.py（256 字节）。工作区：2 个文件，553 字节","tool_call_id":"call_11c6281b17b644e0a127aa47"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_02dbf5c5fb41457a9287be70","type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_shell","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -m unittest discover -s . -p \\\"test_*.py\\\"\"}"}}]},{"name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","content":"状态：completed（退出码 5）\n用时 97 ms\nstdout：（空）\nstderr（108 字节）：\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 0 tests in 0.000s\n\nNO TESTS RAN\n\n文件变化：无\n工作区：2 个文件，553 字节","tool_call_id":"call_02dbf5c5fb41457a9287be70"}],"question":"# Sensor readings are added without converting units\n\nRead `records.py` and the unit conversion contract in `units.py`. Fix\n`sensor_totals` in `records.py` to return each sensor's total in volts,\nsumming negative and positive readings. Preserve rejection of unsupported\nunits as a `ValueError`. Leave the conversion helper unchanged.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","_agentbox":{"call_ids":{"root/orch/chat":4,"root/orch/workspace_exec":1}},"subtopics":{},"phase_subs":null,"restore_note":null,"abandoned_ids":{},"stop_findings":null,"schema_version":1,"carried_question":"","current_subtopic":null,"finish_requested":false,"pending_question":null},"step_id":"orch","attempt_id":"4b598adce1ed00ee3f426f296990848e","checkpoint_id":"68afac5845ba45f7aa46cc77ef116eb5"}}}

